{"root":"sasar","ipa":"/ˈsasər/","core":"指瞄准、针对或偏离目标，常用于描述动作的指向性或状态的偏移。","pos":["动词"],"scenes":["高频","工作"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ˈsasər/","zh":"瞄准；针对；偏离","phrases":[{"t":"sasar ke","zh":"瞄准向..."},{"t":"sasar sasaran","zh":"锁定目标"},{"t":"salah sasar","zh":"瞄准错误"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia sasar ke arah target itu.","zh":"他瞄准了那个目标方向。"},{"t":"Jangan sasar orang yang tidak bersalah.","zh":"不要针对无辜的人。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"sasar","ipa":"/ˈsasər/","zh":"瞄准；针对","phrase":{"t":"sasar tembakan","zh":"瞄准射击"},"example":{"t":"Dia sasar dengan tepat.","zh":"他精准地瞄准了。"}},{"w":"sasaran","ipa":"/saˈsaran/","zh":"目标；靶子","phrase":{"t":"mencapai sasaran","zh":"达到目标"},"example":{"t":"Sasaran utama kita adalah efisiensi.","zh":"我们的主要目标是效率。"}},{"w":"menyasar","ipa":"/məˈɲasar/","zh":"瞄准；针对；偏离（路径）","phrase":{"t":"menyasar pasar","zh":"针对市场"},"example":{"t":"Strategi ini menyasar kaum muda.","zh":"这一策略针对的是年轻人。"}},{"w":"tersasar","ipa":"/tərˈsasər/","zh":"迷路；偏离轨道","phrase":{"t":"tersasar di hutan","zh":"在森林里迷路"},"example":{"t":"Kami tersasar karena peta yang salah.","zh":"因为地图错误，我们迷路了。"}}],"derSlugs":["sasar","sasaran","menyasar","tersasar"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T16:35:43.399Z","src":"base"}